{"code": 1, "data": {"content": "<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"color: #7e8c8d; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"color: #c91623;\">■</span> 本文来源：中国新闻网</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><img src=\"/vendor/wlimg10.360buyimg.com/jdwlcms/jfs/t1/223555/24/13673/198879/63d0bb5cF5d610cca/d3bb399e9b596a75.png\" /></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><br /><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">&ldquo;80后&rdquo;的刘小莉，是郑州为数不多的女快递员。<span style=\"color: #c91623;\"><strong>2022年4月初，在上海疫情期间，她收到公司招募援沪通知时，主动报名前往，援沪70多天，她送了1万余份快递</strong></span>。</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">援沪结束，回到郑州没过多久，她又主动前往焦作支援当地鞋帽市场的快递揽收任务，直至2023年1月初才结束回到郑州。</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">回望2022年，刘小莉告诉记者，<span style=\"color: #c91623;\"><strong>在把快递送到客户手中时，会感到欣慰；也会在高强度工作后感到疲惫，但自己不会被困难打败，会调整好心态，用笑声打败困难，迎接更美好的明天</strong></span>。</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">谈及未来，刘小莉表示，<span style=\"color: #c91623;\"><strong>希望踏踏实实做好每一件事，如果以后哪需要支援，她仍然会义不容辞</strong></span>。</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #c91623;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">&mdash;&mdash;<img src=\"/vendor/wlimg10.360buyimg.com/jdwlcms/jfs/t1/134463/36/29818/855/63d0bb85F88591118/383a525c0d3b8c74.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" /> 初三&middot;纳五福&middot;广开运 <img src=\"/vendor/wlimg10.360buyimg.com/jdwlcms/jfs/t1/149651/20/28913/855/63d0bb8eFcbb1f632/5e9931b5569a0dbe.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" />&mdash;&mdash;</span></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #c91623;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">仓配福神到，送仓万事好</span></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #c91623;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\"><img src=\"/vendor/wlimg10.360buyimg.com/jdwlcms/jfs/t1/178650/14/31667/212698/63d0bb9cF6ace5c9f/8a5574f9a5b5190d.jpg\" /></span></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://getwuce.jdl.com/#/diyForm?formCode=BD3187402377390195328&amp;channelL1Code=l1-ch8&amp;channelCode=wucech87219\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/vendor/wlimg10.360buyimg.com/jdwlcms/jfs/t1/55038/18/17874/43354/63d0bbacFece56608/fa203df7954c8159.png\" /></a></p>", "contentAbstract": "希望踏踏实实做好每一件事", "contentCode": "content01037", "contentTitle": "郑州80后女快递员：用爽朗的笑声打败困难，迎接更美好的明天！", "contentType": 2, "createTime": 1674623569000, "id": 2830, "isDelete": 0, "link": "", "linkType": 0, "projectName": "京东物流官网", "srcUrl": "/vendor/wlimg10.360buyimg.com/jdwlcms/jfs/t1/212853/31/25634/198879/63d0bbbfF0779593f/d789054dec058d07.png", "updateTime": 1674623947000}}